    "Intrinsic label geometry preserves system scaling without a font cap, numberOfLines limit or fixed label height. Scroll viewport adapts from measured content/available width; each complete selected/focused tab is revealed with inset.",
    "Previous/more arrows change scroll offset only. Active state remains bound to the existing route. RAF cleanup and dependency changes reveal current selection after font scale/orientation/route changes; no startup map permission or implicit navigation was added.",
    "Long Greek and explicit newline labels remain whole when selected; accessible full labels/selected states and account/home controls remain present. Measured controls meet at least 44px in the controlled adapter.",
    "Header stacks the tagline at high font scale on narrow widths; labels wrap naturally. New scroll controls, full label rendering and current-tab focus are coherent with horizontal touch/keyboard use."
